@DocuMind.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059

### Register
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "CorrectHorse1", "displayName": "Me", "workspaceName": "Acme Inc" }

### Me (paste the accessToken from the response)
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Refresh
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN" }
